WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:02,300
Brother, I'm not going

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:03,260
let's go back

3
00:00:03,260 --> 00:00:04,180
What nonsense are you talking about?

4
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:06,940
Don't delay me. I'll go there with my mouth full of time. If you don't go,

5
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:07,980
I won't go either

6
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:10,420
Get out of here

7
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:12,230
It’s not easy to find a way out for you

8
00:00:12,230 --> 00:00:13,550
You still want to rely on me

9
00:00:13,550 --> 00:00:15,390
I am your brother, not your father

10
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:18,660
I'm sorry for you, Ji Ze.

11
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:24,920
Don't be a burden to me. Get out of here. Don't be stupid.

12
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:30,020
You are his brother, not his enemy

13
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:32,260
If you love your sister, do it openly and don’t feel ashamed.

14
00:00:32,260 --> 00:00:34,130
This is the radio station from my base

15
00:00:34,130 --> 00:00:35,770
Once you have thought it through, please feel free to contact me.

16
00:00:35,770 --> 00:00:46,030
The most I can ask for in your base is thirty people.

17
00:00:46,030 --> 00:00:46,990
Everyone is gone
